<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Seizz Studio - Game Developer</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
    background: #0d0d1a;
    color: #e8e8f0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ===== NAVBAR ===== */
  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 8%;
    background: rgba(13, 13, 26, 0.95);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f3a;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e0ff, #a855f7);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  nav ul {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  nav ul a {
    color: #b8b8cc;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  nav ul a:hover { color: #00e0ff; }

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero {
    min-height: 85vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 8%;
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #1a1a3d 0%, #0d0d1a 70%);
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(#1f1f3a 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, #1f1f3a 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 50px 50px;
    opacity: 0.25;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black, transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black, transparent 75%);
  }

  .hero > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #00e0ff;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #00e0ff;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero h1 span {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e0ff, #a855f7, #ff4ecd);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #a0a0bb;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }

  .btn {
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e0ff, #a855f7);
    color: #0d0d1a;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 224, 255, 0.35);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #e8e8f0;
    border: 1px solid #3a3a5c;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: #00e0ff;
    color: #00e0ff;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  /* ===== SECTION ===== */
  section { padding: 80px 8%; }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: #8888a5;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  /* ===== GAMES GRID ===== */
  .games-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 25px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .game-card {
    background: #14142b;
    border: 1px solid #23234a;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px 25px;
    transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  .game-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: #00e0ff;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 224, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .game-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e0ff22, #a855f722);
    border: 1px solid #2a2a52;
  }

  .game-card h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .game-card p {
    color: #8b8ba8;
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 15px;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #1f1f42;
    color: #00e0ff;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* ===== ABOUT ===== */
  .about {
    background: #101024;
    display: flex;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-text { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; max-width: 560px; }

  .about-text h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-text h2 span {
    color: #00e0ff;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: #9494b0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 35px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat h4 {
    font-size: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e0ff, #a855f7);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .stat p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #77779a;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .about-visual {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 280px;
    max-width: 450px;
    height: 320px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e0ff15, #a855f715);
    border: 1px solid #23234a;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 90px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-visual::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #00e0ff25, transparent 60%);
  }

  /* ===== CONTACT ===== */
  .contact { text-align: center; }

  .contact-box {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #14142b;
    border: 1px solid #23234a;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 50px 35px;
  }

  .contact-box h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .contact-box p {
    color: #8b8ba8;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .email {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #00e0ff;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .email:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 8%;
    border-top: 1px solid #1f1f3a;
    color: #66668a;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  footer .logo { font-size: 18px; }

  /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav ul { gap: 18px; font-size: 14px; }
    .hero { min-height: 70vh; padding: 50px 6%; }
    section { padding: 60px 6%; }
    .about { gap: 40px; }
    .stats { gap: 25px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    nav { padding: 16px 5%; }
    nav ul { gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
    .logo { font-size: 19px; }
    .btn { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAVBAR -->
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">SEIZZ STUDIO</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#games">Games</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="hero">
    <span class="badge">🎮 Independent Game Studio</span>
    <h1>We Build <span>Games</span><br>That Players Love</h1>
    <p>Seizz Studio creates fun, creative and high-quality games for mobile and PC. From idea to launch — we make it happen.</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="#games" class="btn btn-primary">View Our Games</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Hire Us</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- GAMES -->
  <section id="games">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Games</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">A few titles we've crafted with love</p>

    <div class="games-grid">
      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🚀</div>
        <h3>Space Runner</h3>
        <p>Fast-paced endless runner across galaxies. Dodge asteroids and collect power-ups.</p>
        <span class="tag">MOBILE</span>
      </div>

      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🧩</div>
        <h3>Puzzle Master</h3>
        <p>Brain-teasing levels that get harder as you go. Perfect for casual players.</p>
        <span class="tag">CASUAL</span>
      </div>

      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">⚔️</div>
        <h3>Ninja Legends</h3>
        <p>Action-packed combat with smooth controls and stylish visuals.</p>
        <span class="tag">ACTION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🏎️</div>
        <h3>Turbo Racers</h3>
        <p>Multiplayer racing with real-time physics and custom cars.</p>
        <span class="tag">MULTIPLAYER</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section id="about" class="about">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2>About <span>Seizz Studio</span></h2>
      <p>We're a passionate team of developers, designers and artists who love making games. Our goal is simple — build experiences that are fun, polished and memorable.</p>
      <p>Whether you need a full game developed, a prototype, or help polishing your existing project, we're here to help.</p>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <h4>25+</h4>
          <p>Projects</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h4>5+</h4>
          <p>Years</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h4>100%</h4>
          <p>Passion</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-visual">🕹️</div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="contact-box">
      <h2>Let's Work Together</h2>
      <p>Have a game idea or need a developer? Get in touch — we reply fast.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@seizzstudio.com" class="email">📧 hello@seizzstudio.com</a>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="mailto:hello@seizzstudio.com" class="btn btn-primary">Send Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    <div class="logo">SEIZZ STUDIO</div>
    <p style="margin-top:10px;">© 2025 Seizz Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
